{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57570","headline":"南方歌 · 无名氏","name":"南方歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南方朱雀其身赤，猛烈雄强势难敌。\n性共乾坤造化齐，体并阴阳难消息。\n水妻土母木家子，白帝金形胎受此。\n四象皆因我气生，万类须由我气死。\n性连甲乙气偏通，媾扇金娘嫁木翁。\n归投戊己到中宫，看看变转緫交红。\n此謌不悟殷懃说，句句从头细分雪。\n莫言积学但阴功，始解消详吾志诀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57570.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57570","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}